              # Count unread messages\ngc mail peek <id>                      # Preview a message without marking read\ngc mail read <id>                      # Read a message (marks as read)\ngc mail thread <id>                    # Show full conversation thread\n```\n\n## Managing\n\n```\ngc mail archive <id>                   # Archive a message\ngc mail mark-read <id>                 # Mark as read without displaying\ngc mail mark-unread <id>              # Mark as unread\ngc mail delete <id>                    # Delete a message\ngc mail check                          # Check for new mail (used in hooks)\n```\n  </instructions>\n\n  <available_resources>\n    Showing up to 200 items (files + folders).\n\n/usr/local/google/home/jkramberger/agentic-ipa/ipa-city/.gemini/skills/core.gc-mail/\n└───SKILL.md\n  </available_resources>\n</activated_skill>"}}}],"resultDisplay":"Skill **gc-mail** activated. Resources loaded from `/usr/local/google/home/jkramberger/agentic-ipa/ipa-city/.gemini/skills/core.gc-mail`:\n\nShowing up to 200 items (files + folders).\n\n/usr/local/google/home/jkramberger/agentic-ipa/ipa-city/.gemini/skills/core.gc-mail/\n└───SKILL.md","contentLength":1447},"durationMs":19,"outcome":"proceed_once","schedulerId":"root","approvalMode":"yolo"},{"request":{"callId":"kydouw8t","name":"run_shell_command","args":{"command":"ls -R | grep -i library || find . -maxdepth 2 -not -path '*/.*'","description":"Searching for library related files or directories."},"isClientInitiated":false,"prompt_id":"0966b3e7-c0e2-4088-9943-fa0e16715f3b","traceId":"Sh70afSsCNWGz7IPyqzbuQY","schedulerId":"root"},"tool":{"name":"run_shell_command","displayName":"Shell","description":"This tool executes a given shell command as `bash -c <command>`. Command can start background processes using `&`. Command is executed as a subprocess that leads its own process group. Command process group can be terminated as `kill -- -PGID` or signaled as `kill -s SIGNAL -- -PGID`.\n\n      Effici