mayor-ic-h61 · Assignee: aipa_survey_packs.worker-1 · Type: message\nCreated: 2026-05-01 · Updated: 2026-05-01\n\nDESCRIPTION\nHonorable Worker, I have assigned several new survey tasks to you:\n1. Llama 3 8B (JetStream) - Deployment (ic-mol-ut05)\n2. Llama 3 8B (JetStream GPU) - Deployment (ic-mol-ve8j)\n3. Gemma 7B-it (JetStream) - Deployment (ic-mol-uk6l)\n4. Gemma 7B-it (vLLM) - Manifest Generation/Fix (ic-mol-suz9)\n\nPlease proceed with these tasks and report back on your progress. For the JetStream models, the manifests are already ready in the library. For Gemma 7B-it (vLLM), please diagnose the previous 0% success failure and fix the manifest before deployment.\n\nLABELS: read, thread:thread-6b81d198669e\n\nMETADATA\n  from: aipa_survey_packs.mayor-1\n  mail.from_display: aipa_survey_packs.mayor-1\n  mail.from_session_id: ic-h61\nProcess Group PGID: 1233554","contentLength":950},"durationMs":287,"outcome":"proceed_once","schedulerId":"root","approvalMode":"yolo"}],"schedulerId":"root"}
